# Citation metadata for RPKI Health (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
# The release script fills in "version" and "date-released" below when it
# builds a release snapshot. Do not edit those two values by hand.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "RPKI Health: RPKI Warehouse code"
abstract: >-
  The code behind RPKI Warehouse (https://rpki.netsecurelab.org), a longitudinal
  observatory for the RPKI objects of all five Regional Internet Registries: an
  ETL that loads rpki-client collections and the RIPE NCC RPKI archive into
  per-RIR Parquet warehouses, a read-only API with country analytics, and a web
  dashboard.
authors:
  - name: "NetSecure Lab, Virginia Tech"
  - given-names: Taejoong
    family-names: Chung
    affiliation: Virginia Tech
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-11-02
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/taejoong/rpki-health"
url: "https://rpki.netsecurelab.org"
keywords:
  - RPKI
  - ROA
  - BGP
  - routing security
  - Internet measurement
